WEBVTT

00:04:28.222 --> 00:04:30.167
in the early 1970s.

00:04:30.191 --> 00:04:32.358
I played a leading citizen role

00:04:32.382 --> 00:04:35.177
in lobbying through Congress
the Clean Air Act;

00:04:35.201 --> 00:04:37.907
the clean water laws, EPA;

00:04:37.931 --> 00:04:40.587
workplace safety standards, OSHA;

00:04:40.611 --> 00:04:42.712
and the Safe Drinking Water Act.

00:04:42.736 --> 00:04:45.004
If there's less lead in your body,

00:04:45.028 --> 00:04:47.349
no more asbestos in your lungs

00:04:47.373 --> 00:04:49.281
and cleaner air and water,

00:04:49.305 --> 00:04:52.546
it's because of those laws over the years.

00:04:53.115 --> 00:04:57.345
Today, enforcement of these
lifesaving laws under Trump

00:04:57.369 --> 00:05:00.177
is being dismantled wholesale.